# Smoooth
**Infrastructure freedom, built for AI agents.**

> The infrastructure platform that lets coding agents choose, provision, connect, and operate the technologies an application needs—without forcing every project into the same stack.

> **Core idea:** Supabase-level convenience across the software stack, with the freedom to choose the technologies that fit the product.

| Document | Status | Product Thesis |
| :--- | :--- | :--- |
| Product definition and MVP direction | Working PRD · October 2026 | Agent-first infrastructure orchestration across providers and technologies |

